<title>USA: Laboratory Corp Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Laboratory Corp Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, N.C. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in Millions, Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>				     1997	     1996</p>
<p>Net sales			$391.5	   $403.9</p>
<p>EBITDA			    $49.3	    $48.4</p>
<p>Operating income		$27.8	    $27.8</p>
